s=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016440/extras/9caa473a3c89e8a6b5854fb10fd43e2e.poster.avif?t=1670596907\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016440/extras/9caa473a3c89e8a6b5854fb10fd43e2e.webm?t=1670596907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>Manage and decorate your own clinic and hospital. Hire staff and friends, and decide how much you're willing to pay them. You can even have them work for free, if you can prove yourself!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016440/extras/f88889050a82ea9b52d95b567aed341c.avif?t=1670596907\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016440/extras/d2d36d1dbfbc4641f1bee8ec3fb832b0.poster.avif?t=1670596907\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016440/extras/d2d36d1dbfbc4641f1bee8ec3fb832b0.webm?t=1670596907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>Discover the captivating stories of the world and each of NPCs. Befriend monsters and other hidden races. Solve story scenarios in a few different ways and make decisions that shape your path.  Learn to live in harmony\u2026or be the chaos!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016440/extras/cc5d9f30f1a8aea0511291e53876259a.avif?t=1670596907\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016440/extras/614adc91a5574f52113e3822a1d73c14.poster.avif?t=1670596907\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016440/extras/614adc91a5574f52113e3822a1d73c14.webm?t=1670596907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>Tame monsters and create friendships with them. Wait for the magical things to happen. (They will finish chores for you.)<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016440/extras/68c50ded94f49f807fd6a00d3e33efa7.avif?t=1670596907\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016440/extras/27ef341a9958f8ffbbfc42028655c4a4.poster.avif?t=1670596907\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016440/extras/27ef341a9958f8ffbbfc42028655c4a4.webm?t=1670596907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>Live your life and choose your ultimate career path (hospital tycoon, CEO, school headmaster, farmer, chef, etc) by building the necessary skills---curing patients, farming, fishing, mining, cooking, crafting, etc. Get to know the townspeople. Another meaning to friends with benefits! Befriend all kinds of people to get tons of rewards! You can explore all types of love and desires. Easily Conquer love. YOU CHOOSE!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016440/extras/45751dc009e4770de257b0852313c3df.avif?t=1670596907\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016440/extras/5cb920d1510d72d3ffdf3758ac226dc2.poster.avif?t=1670596907\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016440/extras/5cb920d1510d72d3ffdf3758ac226dc2.webm?t=1670596907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>Discover your Immunis power and forge your own genetic path! Edit your genes to protect yourself from diseases.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016440/extras/a8efc155cad18bd4d1defe39feabf1c9.avif?t=1670596907\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016440/extras/0df3373c583d13a98915fec499f7cdc5.poster.avif?t=1670596907\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016440/extras/0df3373c583d13a98915fec499f7cdc5.webm?t=1670596907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>Save people's lives through various battles by summoning immune cells and fighting bacteria and viruses inside human body!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016440/extras/972448b25f696981f89d26a8c879a43e.avif?t=1670596907\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016440/extras/73c3416055cf16d3bfce886b2f29b812.poster.avif?t=1670596907\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016440/extras/73c3416055cf16d3bfce886b2f29b812.webm?t=1670596907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>By collecting unique cards, build your ultimate Deck and challenge other card players with tons of rewards. (Cards can also be used as items to enhance skills and unlock the world\u2019s secrets, so you might want to collect as many as you can.)<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016440/extras/5218340326aca4d1c16a2e7011b39e99.avif?t=1670596907\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016440/extras/27838ebdaca3e9c0264b97cea255a836.poster.avif?t=1670596907\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016440/extras/27838ebdaca3e9c0264b97cea255a836.webm?t=1670596907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>Play minigames to save patients' lives and raise town reputation and money. Create and discover special dishes through a variety of recipes.",
